; A balanced automated rule must preserve each group's per-unit rounding
; allowance (#3314, #1125).  The rule adds to both balancing groups.

= /Checking/
    Memo:Real         1
    Memo:Real        -1
    [Memo:Virtual]    1
    [Memo:Virtual]   -1

2015-07-02 Real bread
    Expenses:Bread      0.50 bread @ $3.99
    Expenses:Bread      1.50 bread @ $4.99
    Assets:Checking          -$9.49

2015-07-03 Budget bread
    [Budget:Bread]      0.50 bread @ $3.99
    [Budget:Bread]      1.50 bread @ $4.99
    [Budget:Checking]         -$9.49

test bal --flat --no-total Bread
          2.00 bread  Budget:Bread
          2.00 bread  Expenses:Bread
end test
